42:  *
43:  * <ul>
44:  *   <li>{@code GET /tags} lists the caller's tags as {@code {id, value, name, shared, sort_order, path_count}}.</li>
45:  *   <li>{@code POST /tags} with {@code {"name": "...", "shared": false}} creates a tag. A tag of the same name of the
46:  *       caller is a {@link V2ErrorCode#CONFLICT}; a caller has at most {@code user.tag.max.tags} tags.</li>
47:  *   <li>{@code PUT /tags/{id}} with {@code {"name"?, "shared"?}} renames the tag, which gives it a new id and value
48:  *       and queues the rename of the value on the documents, and/or changes whether it is shared, which only changes
49:  *       who sees it.</li>
50:  *   <li>{@code DELETE /tags/{id}} deletes the tag and queues its removal from the documents.</li>
51:  * </ul>
